          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵatite kuti, “AMBUJE Mlungu jwa Isalaeli apelece mtendele kwa ŵandu ŵawo, nipo AMBUJEWO tacitama ku Yelusalemu mpaka ndaŵi syangamala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ngapakusacikwa soni kuti Alefi anyakuleje Tenti ja AMBUJE ni yida yosope yakukamulisya masengo pa kwalambila AMBUJE.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.10.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Det 10:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakusosa kwanilisya maloŵe gambesi ga Daudi, Alefi wosope ŵalembesye mena gawo kuti akatumicileje AMBUJE piŵakwanisyaga yaka 20. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵapegwile masengo gakwakamusya ŵanace ŵa Aloni pa masengo gawo gakupeleka mbopesi ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE, kusamalila luŵala ni yipinda yakwe, ni kusunga yida yosope yene kuti yiŵeje yeswela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.3.5+NUM.3.6+NUM.3.7+NUM.3.8+NUM.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Num 3:5-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakwete soni masengo gakusamalila mkate wakupelecekwa kwa AMBUJE, utandi wakukamulisya masengo pakutaga mbopesi ja utandi, mitanda ja makeke jangali cakusasaŵilisya, cakupeleka cilicose cakocedwa ni mawuta, ni utandi wewanganye ni mawuta ga olifi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Galiji masengo gawo Alefi ŵeleŵa kulinga ni kupima mbopesi syosope syakupelecedwa m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kundaŵi kulikose ni ligulo lililyose ŵatogolelaga ni kwalambila AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atendeje yeleyi masiku gosope pakupeleka kwa AMBUJE mbopesi syakutinisya pa lyuŵa lya sabato, pa cindimba ca pawukuwoneka mwesi ni pa yindimba yine. Masengo gakwatumicila AMBUJE agakamuleje mpaka umi wawo wosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵapegwile masengo gakusamalila Tenti ja AMBUJE ni kwakamusya soni acalongo acimjawo ŵambopesi ŵa lukosyo lwa Aloni pakutumicila m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.32"
            ]
          }
        }
